                <pb facs="0545" n="439" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg439"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Barrett to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-06-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 17,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Barrett asks if Secretary Root will accept invitation of Colombia to stop a
                    day at Cartagena en route Panama-New York. The minister of foreign affairs will
                    be sent to meet the Secretary on his arrival.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
